{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-06",
  "title": "執行反制作戰",
  "storyCode": "14-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a326e075a686a097b4d2c3e4c8aa96df56e40a104edc5655abd8f74821f977db",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行動開始後五十八小時"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*薩卡茲粗口*！武器裝備完全不是一個等級的！這仗要怎麼打？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撤！快撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲王庭軍A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“生命脊椎”氣息明顯，基本可以鎖定位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲王庭軍A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續前進！偵察術師跟進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲王庭軍A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲王庭軍B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有敵人！警戒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲王庭軍指揮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "列陣！當心敵人偷襲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲王庭軍指揮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "步兵開闢戰線，術師法術覆蓋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直屬曼弗雷德的王庭軍精銳部隊……數量很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但好在沒有重型火力，只是拖緩他們的行軍速度的話，我還做得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的讓赫德雷猜對了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厄爾蘇拉知道我們防禦空虛，她也一定會告訴曼弗雷德。我們可以反過來利用這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "軍事委員會一定不希望“生命脊椎”落入敵方手中。到了迫不得已的時候，曼弗雷德一定會選擇毀掉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，拉長戰略縱深，不要與他們正面發生激烈衝突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果曼弗雷德認為他還有機會奪回完整的骸骨，他就不會無節制對著這裡傾瀉火力。這就是我們拖延時間的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要拖得足夠久，我們就還有機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷……這最好行得通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像有一個煩人的影子一直在干擾戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "食腐者的法術——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇傭兵畢竟只是雇傭兵，論單打獨鬥，或者三五個人的小隊作戰，你們可能還可以適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你們哪裡來的勇氣，竟然妄圖參與到真正的戰爭中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直很好奇，像你們這樣的傭兵，到底是為什麼會選擇與軍事委員會為敵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "影子融於更廣闊的黑暗，腐敗卻緊隨其後，絲毫不放過她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情報裡提到過叛軍裡有一個會玩弄影子的傭兵，你就是伊內絲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個外族人，將自己打扮成薩卡茲的模樣，摻和到薩卡茲的戰爭裡——你難道很喜歡薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最討厭格外囉嗦的薩卡茲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陰影從食腐者的腳下暴起，刺向它主人的胸膛，卻只是穿過了層層破敗的布匹。\n影子的利刃被食腐者的束帶緊緊纏住，直到破碎崩解。食腐者的刀已經抵在了伊內絲的喉間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小聰明很多，作為戰士的素養卻不夠，說到底，不過是業餘的雇傭兵罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慶幸吧，我並不認可血魔大君那些對待敵人的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲新的時代就要到來了。像你們這樣誤入迷途的雇傭兵，也應該有一次重新選擇的權利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是這伙雇傭兵的領袖之一？我作為曼弗雷德將軍的副官，一等旗尉娜汀，給你們一個投降的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看上去倒一點也不害怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕你？一個第一次上戰場的雛兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看上去也太好懂了——因為王庭的身分，進入軍事委員會裡學過一些理論，出來以後就在軍隊裡混到了一官半職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為這樣就算懂戰爭了？軍事理論的結業考試難嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會為你無意義的挑釁付出代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要能吸引你的注意力，就不算無意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太業餘了，“一等旗尉”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，這撿來的新武器還真夠勁，那個爛木頭還真沒騙我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼知道我會來救你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隔著幾百米我就聞到你身上的炸藥味了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嘛，我們配合得好像更熟練了點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說得好像我能和你的炸彈腦子同頻一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別廢話了，軍事委員會派來了多少人？我把他們統統炸上天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去哪了？怎麼還有空換了身行頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來的衣服不小心炸開線了，我就地取材撿了些好裝備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說出來我自己都不信，伊內絲，你絕對猜不到我遇到了什麼東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g6_sarkazancientruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……挺結實的嘛爛木頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算炸不死你，炸掉你收藏的這些寶貝也夠讓你心疼的了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些武器與甲胄，是古往今來，薩卡茲的英雄們留下的至尊至貴的神器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的武器，無法摧毀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炸不壞？這麼厲害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就歸我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正放在這山洞裡也是等著爛掉，不如我帶它們去曬曬太陽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕的雇傭兵，對薩卡茲的英雄，應當敬重——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在是什麼情況？曼弗雷德本人在哪裡？我可以拿他來試試我新撿的裝備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要輕舉妄動，製造出太多動靜會打亂我們的計劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？赫德雷又有什麼歪點子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾，你們剛剛錯過了自己最後的求生機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1333_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們拒絕成為軍事委員會的一部分，那就變成戰爭的養料吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g1_originiumcanyon"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡已經可以聽到交戰聲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，雇傭兵的反抗並不激烈，我們的戰士推進得很順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們擊敗這伙雇傭兵固然不難，可是萬一他們走投無路之下想要摧毀“生命脊椎”，我們恐怕很難阻止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，他們一定不會這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這本書，沒有結尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些不知道作者的殘稿，不值得將軍留意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得你，老練的傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很喜歡看書？而且還是這種……充斥著對戰爭的消極態度的書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不必找什麼冠冕堂皇的說辭解釋你的閱讀興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，傭兵。假如你是書的作者，在這本書的最後，你會寫下什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是戰死沙場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當一名戰士處在戰場上，他想到的不該只是自己的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他所想的，應該是哪些人的家園？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你很有同理心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屬下失言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷，對一名作者來說，情感豐沛是必要的本性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但對一名軍人來說，優柔寡斷是最惡劣的品質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不是個優柔寡斷的人，我一定不會放你活到現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你應該回到卡茲戴爾，去當老師，當農人，而不是留在戰場上，繼續你荒唐的傭兵生涯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“生命脊椎”，本該是所有戰士回家的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g1_originiumcanyon"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要放鬆警惕，困獸猶鬥，他們一定會反撲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續施壓，不要給他們任何喘息的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是霧氣凝結為露珠，沒有人看到煙塵何時凝結為一柄袖刃。\n身旁的薩卡茲士兵挺身擋在了曼弗雷德身前，袖刃刺入士兵的身體，停滯了一瞬，也僅僅只有一瞬。\n曼弗雷德得到了一個拔出劍的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一切都在電光石火間發生，法術在曼弗雷德身側凝聚，他的劍刃同時揚起。\n阿斯卡綸的袖刃卻更為迅捷，不再猶豫，沒有遲疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這是遲來的一擊。\n刺客與將軍的兵刃交錯，劃開了生與死。\n也劃開了二人過往的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "長劍貫穿了阿斯卡綸的肩膀。\n袖刃刺入了曼弗雷德的心臟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也算……兌現諾言……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是……真的下定決心……我早已經死在你的手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我後悔過，我還是應該在你離開卡茲戴爾前的那晚殺了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真可惜，我還以為你會更念舊情一點呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "換其他任何一種場合，你應該都可以認出我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，真是乾脆俐落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真不知道該說你太在意他，還是太不在意他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和曼弗雷德預料的一點不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看上去，作為長久以來的對手，你還不夠了解曼弗雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他的確很了解你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g2_giantmonsterspine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "南北兩個方向的防線均已開始與王庭軍交戰。我們正在按計劃緩慢收縮防線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目前戰場情況均在計劃之內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有沒有曼弗雷德的蹤跡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有發現……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的場合，他不該只是穩坐後方指揮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……希望阿斯卡綸那邊順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，她不會回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你果然在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緩兵之計……你們真的以為，堅守住這具骸骨，就能給你們帶來反敗為勝的希望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我給過你機會，我給過你太多次機會——你明明知道，最明智的選擇是什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可悲，你又在讓一批薩卡茲屠戮另一批薩卡茲，曼弗雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的“戰爭”你還沒有打夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真讓我失望啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我在殺死他們，是你的幼稚在殺死他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你早就應該離開。這不就是你一直渴望的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而現在，你的雇傭兵們死在這裡，我的戰士們也死在這裡，僅僅是為了這樣無意義的目的……內戰的教訓還不夠慘痛嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正因為我們都看到過內戰最終變成了什麼樣子，薩卡茲們才不該重蹈覆轍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "內戰已經讓我們失去了一整代年輕人，你們卻還想殺死更多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場面對整個泰拉的戰爭不會有任何結果！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，一定會有結果，也必須有結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明明已經看到了結果，卻不願承認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仇恨與被仇恨……如果這就是軍事委員會的目的，你們的目的明明已經達成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還不明白？正因為已經達成了，我才需要你從這裡抽身而出！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，內戰讓卡茲戴爾失去了一代人，苟活下來的那些，也變成了如今你我的模樣……我們唯一會的生活方式，只是揮劍，殺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想改變這一切，那你為什麼還要留在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能做的，你必須去做的，本來還有更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，之後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我真的返回了卡茲戴爾，我該怎麼向孩子們去描述這片他們父母兄姐埋骨的戰場？我該怎麼讓他們相信，其實存在另一種可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仇恨是團結的手段，而團結不能是又一場仇恨的火種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若戰爭還沒停下，我就不能離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你的選擇，與這片戰場同生共死，是嗎。"
    },
    {
